[2026-09-28T11:45:39.893+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1] 
[2026-09-28T11:45:39.893+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1] 1. Treat the current node as owning the smallest executable feature slice required by its scenarios.
