[2026-09-28T12:33:02.552+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] This template is a single-port web application. The frontend is built with Vite and React, and the backend is an Express server that serves both `/api/*` routes and the compiled frontend from `frontend/dist`.
