[2026-09-28T12:33:02.552+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] ## Project Layout
[2026-09-28T12:33:02.552+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] 
[2026-09-28T12:33:02.552+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] - `frontend/`: React, Vite, Tailwind, Vitest, and frontend tests.
[2026-09-28T12:33:02.552+08:00] [TestDrivenDeveloper][REQ-1-1-1] - `backend/`: Express, SQLite runtime helpers, backend Vitest tests, and Playwright E2E tests.
